"`TreeViewDynamicUpdateMode` is a fully-dynamic `TreeViewUpdateMode` policy that asks the `TreeView` to request text, icon, etc, for items every time it needs them. In this mode the control will does not store any of the data, and so it may change every time the tree is redrawn. This is the default mode for `TreeView` and is generally appropriate except where calculating the text, icons, etc, for an item is expensive, or there is a desire to show a snapshot of an item state that may be unstable."

TreeViewVirtualUpdateMode subclass: TreeViewDynamicUpdateMode [
    name [
        	^#dynamic
    ]
    updateAllItems [
        	view invalidate
    ]
]
